{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "The World of Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The Interview", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 3, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.1", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Identify and describe jobs and careers in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "The Simple Past and The Past Continuous Tenses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you are in an interview, it is common to use a mixture of tenses. They allow you to convey a variety of timelines and action sequences. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past </span> tense to talk past events that are short, for longer situations or for repeated events.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the<span class=\"strong\"> Past Continuous</span> tense to talk about:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>two or more actions in the past; one continues for a period, and the other starts and ends in the past (simple past).</li></ul><br>For example: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">When</span> I <span class=\"underline\">was first getting started </span>in the broadcast industry, I <span class=\"underline\">talked </span> to many different people.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>two or more actions in the past, both happening over a period of time.</li></ul><br>For example: <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"underline\">was studying </span>and I <span class=\"underline\">was working </span>in retail.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ul><li>a temporary activity that takes place over a limited time.</li></ul><br>For example: <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"underline\">was writing </span>for them during the semester.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The form of the <span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span> is:<br><span class=\"italic\">subject + was/were + verb-ing", "type": "text"}, {"content": "NOTE: When you want to ask a question using the<span class=\"strong\"> Past Continuous</span>, the form changes. <br><span class=\"italic\">Was/were + subject + verb-ing ... ? <br><br/>For example:  <br><span class=\"italic\">Were you busy studying for your tests?", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Informational Interview Etiquette", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Here are some tips about what you should do in an informational interview. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"1\"><span class=\"strong\">Treat the meeting like it is a real interview.</span><span class=\"italic\"> Arrive on time and dress like you would for a traditional interview. </li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol> <li value=\"2\"><span class=\"strong\">Prepare 5 to 10 questions.</span><span class=\"italic\"> Ask about the interviewer's experience at the company and how it has changed. Discuss what they like best about their job and what are some challenges. Ask for suggestions and advice for your own career.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"3\"><span class=\"strong\">Be pleasant. </span><span class=\"italic\">Even if the interviewer's advice does not seem appropriate, thank them for it anyway. </li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"4\"><span class=\"strong\">Ask for permission if you want to take notes.</span> <span class=\"italic\"> When you take notes, you demonstrate that you are listening carefully to what the person is saying. </li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"5\"><span class=\"strong\">Ask the names of the interviewer's close colleagues.</span> <span class=\"italic\">Ask for recommendations of people you can meet. Take note of these names and ask if you can mention the interviewer's name when contacting them.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"6\"><span class=\"strong\">Don't abuse your interviewer's busy time. </span><span class=\"italic\">Limit the interview to 30 minutes, unless he or she expresses a willingness to spend more time with you.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<ol><li value=\"7\"><span class=\"strong\">Thank the interviewer at the start and the end of the interview. </span><span class=\"italic\">It is a sign of respect and appreciation for their investment of time.</li></ol>", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "expertise ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an ability or strength a person develops through practice and education", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I really think I could benefit from your expertise.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you may hear in an informational interview.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to pick your brain ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to ask questions of someone who is more knowledgeable on a topic", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I really do appreciate having the opportunity to pick your brain.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "on the right track ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "acting in a way where you are likely to achieve the results you want ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'd say you're already on the right track. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to coordinate ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to organize an activity so that the people involved in it work well together  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When I was starting out at WXBJ, I focused on coordinating and scheduling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to schedule", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to plan that something will happen at a particular time ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: When I was starting out at WXBJ, I focused on coordinating and scheduling.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to dabble in ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do something in a way that is not very serious ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Then, I dabbled in a few things here and there. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "talent booking ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the process of finding people with a special ability to do something well ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I did talent booking for a while , but I always kept my eyes on the main goal. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn9le03ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "With a partner, take turns practicing a mock (not real, but intended to be very similar to a real situation) informational interview. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice asking and answering questions. Remember to use the Simple Past and the Past Continuous tenses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Refer to the tips about interview etiquette on the last page.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I participate in an informational interview. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give descriptions to my partner about professional information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about what I was doing in the past. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Hello, Ms. Wilkinson. Thank you for agreeing to speak with me. I really think I could benefit from your expertise.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: You're welcome. I know when I was first breaking into the field, I took any advice I could get.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I couldn't agree more. I really do appreciate having the opportunity to pick your brain.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Any time. Based on your education I'd say you're already on the right track. Did you join any organizations at Harvard, or were you too busy studying?"}, {"image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img07.jpg", "time": "31000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: The course load was heavy, of course, but I was writing for the <span class=\"italic\">Harvard Lampoon</span> in between classes and assignments.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Good. In your e-mail you mentioned that you were copy editing and that you were publishing content for social media. Is that correct?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: That's correct. On top of that, I was also working with the CEO to develop an offline marketing campaign. I really want to build up my skill set.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: That's great, and there's certainly nothing wrong with learning new skills, but there's something to be said for gaining an in-depth knowledge of one particular area."}, {"image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img05.jpg", "time": "67000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I see what you're saying. I guess the cost of being a jack-of-all-trades is that you're a  master of none.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Exactly. Take me, for example. When I was starting out at WXBJ, I focused on coordinating and scheduling. Sure, I dabbled in talent booking, but I kept my eyes on the main goal.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I see. So I should spend my efforts developing the skills I hope to use most in the future?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Exactly.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Great advice. I'm so glad I met with you!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Me too."}, {"image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img06.jpg", "time": "101000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Who else would you recommend I speak with?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: There are a few people I would recommend. Why don't I send you an e-mail tomorrow with their names and contact information?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: That would be great! Thank you!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn9le03ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn9le03ob09re2img06.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can give descriptions about professional information.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about what I was doing in the past.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can participate in an informational interview.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Who would you like to do an informational interview with? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Why do you think it's a good idea to talk to a professional about their job?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "It's time for the interview!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Kristi meets with Danielle Wilkinson, a former <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">radio personality</span>!  Is she <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_1\">a jack-of-all-trades, master of none</span>?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"content": [{"content": "A <span class=\"italic\">\u201cradio personality\u201d</span> is someone who works on air at a radio station.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}, {"content": "A <span class=\"italic\">\u201cjack-of-all-trades, master of none\u201d</span> is a person who is good at many things but not great at anything.", "tip_id": 1, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "id": 1, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0}]}], "type": "STI", "id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "\nWhat was Danielle doing before she got this <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_2_0\">gig</span>?\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Read the dialogue. Select all the phrases that do NOT talk about events that happened or were happening in the past. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": " You have 2 attempts to submit your answers.\n", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}, {"content": [{"content": "A <span class=\"italic\">\u201cgig\u201d</span> is an informal term referring to your job.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}, {"content": "secondary_1", "type": "objective"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": false, "id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>:", "type": "text"}], "s